  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/57aabd2213bbc530ba857ed7cacc9fc2a96ff57c?download\" data-file-name=\"음식물 속 영양소 검출하기 수행평가(반응판).hwp\" data-file-size=\"16384\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D408%26fileid%3D11%26regdt%3D20191029143757&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F57aabd2213bbc530ba857ed7cacc9fc2a96ff57c')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">음식물 속 영양소 검출하기 수행평가(반응판)</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">16.00KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3d0d98d6b2f7006f59bd7bbb8620070a2a07d669?download\" data-file-name=\"음식물 속 영양소 검출하기 수행평가.hwp\" data-file-size=\"212992\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D408%26fileid%3D12%26regdt%3D20191029143757&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F3d0d98d6b2f7006f59bd7bbb8620070a2a07d669')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">음식물 속 영양소 검출하기 수행평가</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">208.00KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-html\" data-ke-type=\"html\" data-source=\"&lt;div class=&quot;txc-textbox&quot; style=&quot;border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); padding: 10px; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 19.2000007629395px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 25.6000003814697px; font-size: 11pt;&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&amp;gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 19.2000007629395px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 25.6000003814697px; font-size: 11pt;&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 19.2000007629395px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.6;&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt; line-height: 1.6;&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size23&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt;&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\"><div data-ke-class=\"article\"><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); padding: 10px; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6000003814697px; font-size: 11pt;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6000003814697px; font-size: 11pt;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px; text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.6;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 18pt; line-height: 1.6;\" data-ke-size=\"size23\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>미지용액A~E와 검출반응시약을 주고 개별로 실험보고서를 작성하도록 하였습니다<span data-ke-size=\"size16\">.</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">베네딕트용액은 온수기에 대량으로 물을 끓여 개별로 비커에 담아주었고, A~E의 시험관도 라벨링하여 주었습니다</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">손이 정말 많이가는 수행평가인데,&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">과학실무원 선생님이 계셨기에 라벨링작업 및 실험준비를 할 수 있었습니다^~</span><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">^</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">&#160;</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">예비실험 없이 이론 수업 후에 개별로 수행하였는데도 학생들이 너무 잘 따라와주었고, 시험인데 재미있다고하여 보람되고 뿌듯했답니다^^</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">&#160;</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160; &#160; &#160;&#160;&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;&#160;&#160;&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">&#160;&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">&#160; &#160;&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">&#160; &#160;&#160;</span></p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99D0014A5DB7D00F1F\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99D0014A5DB7D00F1F\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"768\"></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9983174A5DB7D01022\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9983174A5DB7D01022\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"768\"></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9927F24A5DB7D01225\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9927F24A5DB7D01225\" data-origin-